---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Writings"
---

{% set sidebar_items = [
  { label: "Ancestors", url: "/people/" },
  { label: "Families", url: "/families/" },
  { label: "Index", url: "/index/" },
  { label: "Writings", url: "/writings/" }
] %}

<div class="section-layout">
  {% include "partials/section-sidebar.njk" %}

  <div class="section-content">
    <div class="page-header">
      <h1>Writings</h1>
      <p class="page-intro">
        Full-length pieces written by family members themselves — memoirs, manuscripts, and published work — reproduced here rather than just cited. Where a person named in one of these pieces has their own profile, their name links there; everyone named is also gathered on the <a href="/index/">Name Index</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="page-intro">
        This section is new and growing slowly and deliberately, one piece at a time. Some of what's written here reflects the language and attitudes of when and where it was written rather than how the site's own research pages are written; look for a content note at the top of a piece where that applies.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="journal-list">
      {%- for entry in collections.writings | reverse %}
      {%- if entry.data.kind == "work" %}
      <article class="journal-card">
        <h2 class="journal-card__title">
          <a href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.data.title }}</a>
        </h2>
        {% if entry.data.byline %}<p class="journal-card__date">{{ entry.data.byline }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if entry.data.excerpt %}
        <p class="journal-card__excerpt">{{ entry.data.excerpt }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        {% if entry.data.sensitivity_tags and entry.data.sensitivity_tags.length %}
        <div class="journal-card__sensitivity-flag">
          <span class="journal-sensitivity-label">Heads up:</span>
          {% for s in entry.data.sensitivity_tags %}<span class="journal-sensitivity-tag">{{ s }}</span>{% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </article>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if collections.writings.length == 0 %}
    <p class="text-muted text-sans">Nothing published yet — check back soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>
